# Wi-Fi networks for Sophi's walker.
#
# To add a network from any computer: put the walker's SD card in the computer, open this file
# (wifi.txt, on the card's "bootfs" drive), add a block like the one below, save, and put the card
# back in the walker. On its next start the walker adds the network and replaces the password here
# with "(saved)", so the password doesn't stay on the card. Leave the password empty for an open
# network. Networks that need a sign-in web page won't work. At Cal Hacks phone hotspots are
# banned: the walker uses the venue's Ethernet, and a venue Wi-Fi added here is only a backup, to
# switch off for the demo (nmcli connection modify "walker: <name>" connection.autoconnect no).
#
# name: Example Network
# password: example-password
